{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_170523745#4_389495218","relevance":2,"reason":"The passage identifies aging-related workplace issues in nursing, including an aging population increasing labor demand, an RN workforce nearing retirement, and difficulties attracting and retaining workers. However, the document appears focused on international nursing vacancies rather than dedicated to aging and workplace issues generally.","learned":"Aging can affect workplaces by increasing service demand while parts of the workforce approach retirement, contributing to shortages and retention challenges."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1974","reason":"The current aging-workforce employer query has produced multiple strong results and may continue to return evidence on retirement, skills gaps, and workforce planning."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1974"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_533278055#12_1266169620","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1974","rank":4,"snippet":"9044.000000 , \"headings\": \"Fixed Income Trader: Job Description and Salary Fixed Income Trader: Job Description and Salary Key Takeaways What Does a Fixed Income Trader Do? Product Knowledge Experience and Education Licensing Skills Communication <cover>Skills Juggling Tasks Technical Knowledge Salary Job Outlook \" , \"segment\": \"These figures were current as of August 2019. Job Outlook Investment in fixed-income products is on the rise as an aging workforce looks to retire. Fixed income trader positions will continue to open as more retirees turn to bonds over annuities as a means of supplementing and augmenting income streams to replace former employers. The baby boomer generation that is set to retire was the largest group of workers in the U.S. until 2016, when it was surpassed by the younger millennial generation. Regardless, the baby boomer generation still accounts for a large portion of the workforce and as it nears retirement, </cover>demand for lower risk instruments such as bonds and other fixed income products will likely continue driving the need for fixed income traders. Take the Next Step to Invest Advertiser Disclosure × The offers that appear in this table are from partnerships "}}
