{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1434947726#8_3238865640","relevance":2,"reason":"This is another passage from a broader NIOSH strategic research plan that directly notes aging-related workplace issues such as variability in work ability and occupational safety and health outcomes among older workers, but it is not a document dedicated specifically to aging and the workplace.","learned":"Repeated evidence: chronological age alone is not a strong predictor of workplace outcomes; older workers vary in work ability and occupational safety/health outcomes."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"age-friendly workplaces\" \"older workers\")","reason":"Search directly for documents dedicated to age-friendly workplaces and older workers, likely to provide grade-3 evidence on practical workplace issues and responses to workforce aging."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"age-friendly workplaces\" \"older workers\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_47_498064925#9_1012986916","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1980","rank":1,"snippet":"to do so. These ages should be clearly documented in your relevant employment documents. You should also include avenues where your employees can seek help from if there are disputes. See some sample clauses for the employment documents . Structured career planning sessions Show As an employer, you are encouraged to adopt a forward-looking approach in guiding your employees on career development, including use of structured career planning sessions. You will benefit through a deeper understanding of your employees’ future plans, and they can build confidence in planning their careers and prepare them for career changes, re-employment and eventual retirement. Job redesign Show As an employer, you should facilitate the re-employment of <cover>older workers by building more age-friendly workplaces. </cover>You are encouraged to use job redesign to make organisation-wide and system-levels changes. This will increase the number of older workers who can perform the job, and increase the age at which your workers can do a job.\" , \"start_char\": 4912.000000 , \"title\": \"Responsible re-employment\" , \"url\": \"https://www.mom.gov.sg/employment-practices/re-employment\" }"}}
